WEBVTT

00:13:29.817 --> 00:13:32.261
very optimistic.

00:13:32.261 --> 00:13:35.775
You are somebody who is so passionate.

00:13:35.775 --> 00:13:39.622
You are somebody who wants to see a better world.

00:13:39.622 --> 00:13:44.128
You are somebody who wants to see that war ends, no poverty.

00:13:44.128 --> 00:13:46.877
You are somebody who wants to make a difference.

00:13:46.877 --> 00:13:50.443
You are somebody who wants to make our tomorrow better.

00:13:50.443 --> 00:13:54.221
I want to challenge you today that to be the first,

00:13:54.221 --> 00:13:56.718
because people will follow you.

00:13:56.718 --> 00:13:58.942
Be the first. People will follow you.

00:13:58.942 --> 00:14:04.225
Be bold. Stand up. Be fearless. Be confident.